    "Question #: 7": {
      "Title": "Exam 1z0-883 topic 1 question 34 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A Mysql instance is running on a dedicated server. Developers access the server from the same network subnet. Users access the database through an application that is running on a separate server in a DMZ."
